      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毕竟场地跟气候都跟日本完全不一样，\n当地的准备也是不可或缺……",
      "source_fingerprint": "79bb63356836fdbaf487c0d6d27e9c1a5a3eeda5ac7d4e9ca124aec2cc096536",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
